WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.866 --> 00:00:16.434
Henry and his friends waited for a while.

2
00:00:17.274 --> 00:00:17.775
But Mrs.

3
00:00:17.815 --> 00:00:20.176
Sweet didn't come out from the back room of the Sweet Shop.

4
00:00:21.557 --> 00:00:23.038
Finally they gave up and left.

5
00:00:24.459 --> 00:00:28.422
"We should go see how Nathan is doing at the lemonade stand," Henry said.

6
00:00:28.442 --> 00:00:31.124
"We've been gone for a long time."

7
00:00:32.244 --> 00:00:33.125
The others agreed.

8
00:00:40.348 --> 00:00:44.111
Back at the stand, Nathan was serving lemonade to some construction workers.

9
00:00:44.131 --> 00:00:48.333
"Hi, guys," Nathan greeted his friends as the men left.

10
00:00:48.353 --> 00:00:50.594
"Business has been great today!

11
00:00:51.414 --> 00:00:52.535
How's the mystery going?"

12
00:00:52.555 --> 00:00:55.477
"Not so great," Henry admitted.

13
00:00:56.657 --> 00:00:58.718
He and his friends told Nathan about the case.

14
00:00:58.738 --> 00:01:01.320
"Wow," Nathan said.

15
00:01:02.092 --> 00:01:03.213
"That's weird that Mrs.

16
00:01:03.273 --> 00:01:04.593
Sweet rushed off like that."

17
00:01:05.514 --> 00:01:06.794
"Yeah," Cole agreed.

18
00:01:06.814 --> 00:01:08.915
"She acted like she was guilty."

19
00:01:08.935 --> 00:01:12.277
"But she's not guilty," Maggie insisted.

20
00:01:13.097 --> 00:01:15.298
"She's way too nice to be a flavor thief!

21
00:01:15.538 --> 00:01:17.019
We have to prove she didn't do it!"

22
00:01:17.039 --> 00:01:21.441
"That means we have to prove that someone else did do it," Cole said.

23
00:01:21.461 --> 00:01:23.522
"Like Robby, for instance.

24
00:01:24.382 --> 00:01:26.043
He seemed really mad at Mr.

25
00:01:26.063 --> 00:01:27.883
Tate." "Yeah!"

26
00:01:28.164 --> 00:01:28.744
Maggie said.

27
00:01:29.532 --> 00:01:30.672
"Maybe he hates Mr.

28
00:01:30.692 --> 00:01:32.553
Tate so much that he tricked Mrs.

29
00:01:32.613 --> 00:01:34.433
Sweet into inventing that flavor!"

30
00:01:34.453 --> 00:01:36.574
"How would he do that?"

31
00:01:36.854 --> 00:01:37.634
Nathan asked.

32
00:01:37.654 --> 00:01:39.415
"I don't know."

33
00:01:39.875 --> 00:01:40.595
Maggie shrugged.

34
00:01:40.615 --> 00:01:42.616
"But I know Mrs.

35
00:01:42.656 --> 00:01:44.256
Sweet didn't do anything wrong."

36
00:01:45.277 --> 00:01:46.137
Henry sighed.

37
00:01:46.157 --> 00:01:47.697
"I like Mrs.

38
00:01:47.737 --> 00:01:48.798
Sweet too, Maggie.

39
00:01:49.238 --> 00:01:50.958
But we have to be logical.

40
00:01:51.978 --> 00:01:55.639
Mrs. Sweet has a good motive to cause trouble for the Dessert Den.

41
00:01:56.580 --> 00:02:01.790
And don't forget, she has the exact same flavor right there on her sign.

42
00:02:02.811 --> 00:02:06.113
Plus, she acted weird when we asked her about it just now."

43
00:02:06.133 --> 00:02:09.455
"All that stuff is true," Cole said.

44
00:02:09.475 --> 00:02:10.675
"If Mrs.

45
00:02:10.775 --> 00:02:13.597
Sweet was mean, I'd definitely think she was the thief.

46
00:02:14.557 --> 00:02:17.759
But how could someone who seems so nice do something so rotten?"

47
00:02:18.740 --> 00:02:19.540
Henry shrugged.

48
00:02:20.220 --> 00:02:22.101
He didn't have an answer for Cole's question.

49
00:02:22.121 --> 00:02:24.583
"Maybe you guys should go talk to Mr.

50
00:02:24.623 --> 00:02:26.504
Tate again," Nathan suggested.

51
00:02:27.412 --> 00:02:29.714
"That might give you some new ideas about the case.

52
00:02:31.136 --> 00:02:33.378
I'll keep watching the lemonade stand if you want.

53
00:02:34.198 --> 00:02:35.480
I can use the extra money."

54
00:02:36.400 --> 00:02:37.441
Maggie groaned.

55
00:02:37.461 --> 00:02:39.343
"It's so hot out.

56
00:02:40.084 --> 00:02:43.047
Do we really have to ride all the way back to West Belltown?"

57
00:02:43.067 --> 00:02:45.069
"If you want to clear Mrs.

58
00:02:45.129 --> 00:02:46.910
Sweet's name, we do," Cole said.

59
00:02:46.930 --> 00:02:48.572
"Come on, let's go."

60
00:02:56.096 --> 00:02:59.139
When The Lemonade Detectives reached the Dessert Den, Mr.

61
00:02:59.179 --> 00:03:01.521
Tate saw them coming and hurried to unlock the door.

62
00:03:07.947 --> 00:03:08.688
you solve the case?"

63
00:03:09.088 --> 00:03:09.609
he asked.

64
00:03:09.629 --> 00:03:10.970
"Did Mrs.

65
00:03:11.030 --> 00:03:12.692
Sweet admit that she stole my flavor?"

66
00:03:13.833 --> 00:03:15.734
"Not exactly," Henry said.

67
00:03:15.754 --> 00:03:18.877
"We didn't get to talk to her for very long."

68
00:03:20.439 --> 00:03:21.480
Mr. Tate frowned.

69
00:03:22.272 --> 00:03:26.855
"Well, once you kids finally get her to admit she's guilty, I'll pay your five-dollar detective fee."

70
00:03:26.875 --> 00:03:29.296
"We still don't believe she did it!"

71
00:03:29.636 --> 00:03:30.517
Maggie blurted out.

72
00:03:31.457 --> 00:03:33.358
She glanced at Henry and Cole with a frown.

73
00:03:33.378 --> 00:03:35.579
"At least I don't."

74
00:03:35.599 --> 00:03:37.621
"Huh?" Mr.

75
00:03:37.641 --> 00:03:38.721
Tate looked confused.

76
00:03:38.741 --> 00:03:42.963
"We have a few theories," Henry explained calmly.

77
00:03:42.983 --> 00:03:48.166
"We need to rule out other suspects before we can be sure Mrs.

78
00:03:48.206 --> 00:03:49.167
Sweet is the culprit."

79
00:03:50.107 --> 00:03:50.848
"Other suspects?"

80
00:03:51.616 --> 00:03:53.758
Mr. Tate folded his arms across his chest.

81
00:03:53.778 --> 00:03:55.119
"Like who?"

82
00:03:55.139 --> 00:03:58.402
"Um, there's this kid, Robby," Cole said.

83
00:03:58.422 --> 00:04:00.783
"He seems to hate the Dessert Den.

84
00:04:01.424 --> 00:04:02.365
We're not sure why."

85
00:04:02.385 --> 00:04:05.087
"Yeah," Maggie put in.

86
00:04:05.107 --> 00:04:07.389
"Or it could all be a coincidence.

87
00:04:07.689 --> 00:04:11.212
The flavor bubble gum banana swirl isn't that unique, you know."

88
00:04:12.253 --> 00:04:13.574
Mr. Tate rolled his eyes.

89
00:04:13.594 --> 00:04:16.236
"Look, my grand opening is tomorrow.

90
00:04:16.736 --> 00:04:18.097
I don't have time to fool around.

91
00:04:18.878 --> 00:04:20.559
Do you want to solve this case or not?"

92
00:04:20.799 --> 00:04:21.320
he asked.

93
00:04:22.272 --> 00:04:24.593
"If you don't, I can find someone else to help me.

94
00:04:25.874 --> 00:04:27.134
Like the police, for instance.

95
00:04:28.074 --> 00:04:29.395
Or maybe I'll go to the press.

96
00:04:30.535 --> 00:04:33.497
I heard there's an award-winning investigative reporter in this town.

97
00:04:34.277 --> 00:04:36.158
Maybe he can figure out what's going on."

98
00:04:37.178 --> 00:04:38.279
Henry realized Mr.

99
00:04:38.299 --> 00:04:39.839
Tate was talking about his father.

100
00:04:39.859 --> 00:04:44.321
"The Lemonade Detectives will solve your case," he said.

101
00:04:45.302 --> 00:04:46.222
"No matter what."

102
00:04:47.082 --> 00:04:49.143
He gave Cole and Maggie a shove toward the door.

103
00:04:49.163 --> 00:04:50.944
"Come on, guys.

104
00:04:51.368 --> 00:04:52.369
Let's get back to work."

105
00:04:54.570 --> 00:04:55.830
Soon they were outside again.

106
00:04:55.850 --> 00:04:58.152
"What was that all about, Henry?"

107
00:04:58.472 --> 00:04:59.192
Maggie asked.

108
00:04:59.212 --> 00:05:01.413
"Why'd you rush us out of there?

109
00:05:02.314 --> 00:05:03.695
I thought we were going to ask Mr.

110
00:05:03.735 --> 00:05:05.416
Tate more questions about the case."

111
00:05:06.456 --> 00:05:09.218
"We can't let him go to the police," Henry said.

112
00:05:09.238 --> 00:05:12.279
"Or ask my dad to investigate either."

113
00:05:12.299 --> 00:05:14.000
"Why not?"

114
00:05:14.180 --> 00:05:14.881
Cole asked.

115
00:05:14.901 --> 00:05:17.662
"Maybe your dad can help us prove that Mrs.

116
00:05:17.762 --> 00:05:18.643
Sweet is innocent."

117
00:05:18.663 --> 00:05:21.044
"Maybe," Henry said.

118
00:05:21.872 --> 00:05:26.134
"But if people hear he's investigating her, they might assume she's guilty.

119
00:05:27.195 --> 00:05:29.656
And that would probably be bad for her business."

120
00:05:30.617 --> 00:05:31.938
Suddenly Maggie gasped.

121
00:05:31.958 --> 00:05:33.839
"That's it!"

122
00:05:34.179 --> 00:05:34.659
she cried.

123
00:05:34.679 --> 00:05:37.941
"I have a new theory about what's going on!

124
00:05:38.741 --> 00:05:40.582
If we can prove it, it'll clear Mrs.

125
00:05:40.602 --> 00:05:41.283
Sweet's name!"

126
00:05:41.303 --> 00:05:43.864
"Really? What's your theory?"

127
00:05:44.104 --> 00:05:44.784
Cole asked.

128
00:05:44.804 --> 00:05:46.766
"We've been taking Mr.

129
00:05:46.786 --> 00:05:49.267
Tate's word about what happened," Maggie said.

130
00:05:49.287 --> 00:05:51.008
"But what if he's lying?

131
00:05:51.661 --> 00:05:53.813
What if he's the one who stole that flavor?"
